<h3 class="wp-block-heading has-dark-color has-text-color">Our Strategy: &nbsp;Accelerate innovation</h3>



<div style="height:15px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<figure class="wp-block-image size-large"><img decoding="async" width="970" height="629" src="https://www.ornl.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Materials_Physics_Neutrino_LEGEND-1000_vacuum-chamber-3d-printed-sample-970x629.jpg" alt="" class="wp-image-96991" style="aspect-ratio:16/9;object-fit:cover" srcset="https://www.ornl.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Materials_Physics_Neutrino_LEGEND-1000_vacuum-chamber-3d-printed-sample-970x629.jpg 970w, https://www.ornl.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Materials_Physics_Neutrino_LEGEND-1000_vacuum-chamber-3d-printed-sample-463x300.jpg 463w, https://www.ornl.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Materials_Physics_Neutrino_LEGEND-1000_vacuum-chamber-3d-printed-sample-768x498.jpg 768w, https://www.ornl.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Materials_Physics_Neutrino_LEGEND-1000_vacuum-chamber-3d-printed-sample-1536x995.jpg 1536w, https://www.ornl.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Materials_Physics_Neutrino_LEGEND-1000_vacuum-chamber-3d-printed-sample-2048x1327.jpg 2048w" sizes="(max-width: 970px) 100vw, 970px" /></figure>



<p class="has-dark-color has-text-color wp-block-paragraph">Ensuring U.S. leadership in the development, manufacture, and<br>deployment of materials, chemistries, and components for energy and security applications.</p>


<div class="wp-block-ornl-blocks-buttons ornl-button-group ornl-button-group--justification--left ornl-button-group--direction--row component-button-group" data-context="ornl-buttons-d16cab97-567f-43fa-9977-8f00f40927fb--button-group">
    <a class="component-button--call-to-action ornl-button--tone-dark component-button ornl-button has-icon" data-context="ornl-call-to-action-button-1b4456dd-3efe-4ea8-bd06-3ef7eabd4ddf--call-to-action-button--button" href="https://www.ornl.gov/atoms-to-applications/">
    <span class="ornl-button__label ">Explore Atoms to Applications</span>
            
<span class="component-icon ornl-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-context="ornl-call-to-action-button-1b4456dd-3efe-4ea8-bd06-3ef7eabd4ddf--call-to-action-button--icon">

