<h2 class="wp-block-heading has-dark-color has-text-color">Operations</h2>



<p class="has-dark-color has-text-color wp-block-paragraph">Explore how operational excellence guides the way we plan, perform and improve our work at ORNL as we take on some of the nation’s most important scientific and technical challenges.</p>


